OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FIt will be
OL,6,Fgenerally mild and cloudy overnight,
OL,7,Fwith spells of drizzle mainly for
OL,8,Fnorthern hills. Some clear spells in
OL,9,Fthe south and east bring a risk of fog
OL,10,Fpatches before dawn. Winds easing to a
OL,11,Flight breeze.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTuesday:FTuesday looks brighter than
OL,14,FMonday, but still largely cloudy
OL,15,Fespecially in the north. A risk of
OL,16,Fdrizzly showers for most, with more
OL,17,Fpersistent rain arriving in the north
OL,18,Fovernight.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
