OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FRain
OL,6,Fclearing on Wednesday then feeling
OL,7,Fcooler with sunny spells, and showers
OL,8,Fmainly for northern coasts and hills.
OL,9,FShowers then easing through Thursday
OL,10,Fbefore unsettled weather returns into
OL,11,FFriday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
